#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0267 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "ADURU is not declared on the dataset at all. Requirements.Variables.All [ADURU, ADURN] gates the rule on the presence of the pair, so with one half absent the rule never executes - the absent-optional-variable contract, asserted as skipped rather than borrowed as noViolation. The two rows carry a populated ADURN, i.e. data that would fire if the rule ran."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col ADURN   type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | 5
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | NAUSEA   | 3
